# Facio SwiftUI

Read `.cursor/skills/facio-swiftui/SKILL.md` and the SwiftUI expert skill before writing views.

```swift
// ❌ BAD — second drift law, or a prompt as home
TabView { ChatHome(); Desk() }

// ✅ GOOD — lid is home; law matches packages/domain/fixtures
// 4-column pack, rank order, gaps allowed
```

- Identity: `com.anovisoft.facio`, team `SXXLPXXJMD`, iOS 18+, portrait. See `docs/state/identity.md`.
- Use has no instance swipe. Left-edge interactive pop is back (system bar, do not hide it). Pan gutter and ☰ only on lid root.
- Liquid Glass on (PO). No brand-green accent. Semantic colors. Material fallback below iOS 26. `GlassEffectContainer` is for Use −/+, not the lid pack.
- Theme follows the system. Atmosphere is a weak gradient in `containerBackground`, never hit-tests. Whole tile opens Use. Counter Use keeps steppers after done. Lid tick is a 36pt symbol overlay — not a Button inside FacioTileButton. Soon/Postponed glance-only (no live ticks); tap → Inspect. Kebab is `facioKebab` overlay, not a nested Button.
- Reminder: wide 4×2 row like other tiles (kebab, primary title). 4×1 overflows the next tile. Use time is a live chip + `@State` after save; tap opens a ~340pt bottom sheet: wide hour/minute wheels + Сохранить at the bottom. No sheet title, no DatePicker, no `.clipped` on the wheel, no Atmosphere on the sheet, no `.fitted` / `.medium`. `@Observable` draft → parent callback → `commit` replaces the whole snapshot once. Enqueue reminders on reminder writes **and launch**; `sync` is not public. Coalesce overlapping sync. `markCueSurfaced` once per place per day from the journal. No `generation` poke. Gym hours 06:00…closes_at.
- Drift: Today card, chips only down (сегодня / раз в неделю / убрать). Not Use. Chips hug text (height 32, max 152 then …), wrap if needed — not equal-width stretch. Hide that subject’s tiles while the card is up. `stop` is not drawn. Empty Today copy when **visible** Today is empty. Do not recurse `visibleToday`. No delta morning engine, no invented morning push hour.
- Pan: under the lid, from lid root only (☰ + 20pt gutter). Keyboard up: gutter off. Use/Inspect: left edge = back. Talks = archive, opens the thread sheet. Deeds = practices, opens kebab inspector. Lid is a full-device card (not a safe-area rectangle): offset + device corner radius; dim on the card; pan above the left strip. Restore leading `pagePadding` for «Facio» when the card is shifted. Long-press on a tile opens kebab; tap does not also fire. `+` creates a new instance. Inspect is look-only with a chip strip (not a full-screen pager). No composer dock on Inspect.
- Talk: dock on lid and Use via `facioComposerDock()` on those screens, not on `NavigationStack` (Use «Готово» would sit under the dock). Tap → ~0.94 sheet, handle to collapse. Collapse does not new-chat. New chat is top-trailing on the sheet. Sheet field is single-line, vertically centered on the send button — no `axis: .vertical`. Centered snapshots are pictures. Key stays on the server (`FacioTalkURL`). No Atmosphere on the talk sheet. Pan Talks is the archive, not the sheet.
